orbitopt — third-party notices
=============================

The full list of third-party components, their licenses and their
GPL-3.0-or-later compatibility is in THIRD_PARTY.md; this file reproduces
the license text of the one component that is an external binary rather
than a library dependency.

OpenTsiolkovsky
---------------

orbitopt's Flight Lab ascent adapter (`orbitopt.flightlab.adapters.
opentsiolkovsky`) optionally drives OpenTsiolkovsky, a 3-DOF launch
vehicle trajectory simulator by Interstellar Technologies
(https://github.com/istellartech/OpenTsiolkovsky), pinned to release
v1.0.0 and installed by `scripts/fetch_opentsiolkovsky.py` into
`~/.cache/orbitopt/bin/` (or `$ORBITOPT_OPENTSIOLKOVSKY`).

The OpenTsiolkovsky binary is NOT vendored in this GPL-3.0-or-later
repository; it is downloaded at setup time so that the MIT-licensed tool
stays outside the GPL tree and is only invoked as a separate process.
Recorded test fixtures under `tests/fixtures/flightlab/opentsiolkovsky/`
were produced by OpenTsiolkovsky v1.0.0. OpenTsiolkovsky is provided
under the MIT license:

